    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">You can draw out more power from within the bones you carry, as its fleeting legacy passes further into you. When you take this feat, choose a skill you are at least Trained in, representing a similar aptitude that the ancestor whose bones you hold shares with you. Each day during your daily preparations, you can select a skill feat from that skill that you meet the level and skill requirements for at the same time you choose your occult cantrip for the day.</span></p>"
